docs {
  # Tross Scraper API
  
  Bruno collection for the LinkedIn Profile API.
  
  ## Endpoints
  
  - `GET /public/v1/health` — liveness, safe to expose publicly
  - `GET /private/v1/health/live` — liveness, for the orchestrator
  - `GET /private/v1/health/ready` — readiness; probes Postgres and Redis and
    returns 503 when a dependency is down
  
  ## Setup
  
  Select the `local` environment, or override `host` to point at a deployment.
}
